		(uuid "2cf0d163-451b-59d8-9f0b-54571c89184f"))
	(text "RF output A: 50 Ohm pull-ups, 100 pF DC blocks; OUTAM terminated in 50 Ohm (B unused)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 383.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2))
			(justify left bottom))
		(uuid "811d5551-1540-502a-82fd-a12efa67bb73"))
	(text "CW synthesizer notes (completed from the TI typical application)\n- Carrier: 2400-2483.5 MHz ISM. VCO 3.55-7.1 GHz, CHDIV=2 -> 2.4 GHz on OUTA.\n- Reference: 26 MHz TCXO. The PFD can use the OSCin doubler (52 MHz) in fractional mode.\n- SPI: SCK/SDI/CSB from the nRF52840; MUXout = lock detect or SPI readback.\n- CE has a 100k pull-down on the MCU sheet: the synth stays off until firmware enables it.\n- OUTB powered down in firmware; pins left open.\n- Loop filter: PFD 52 MHz (OSC_2X), Icp 7.27 mA -> LBW ~59 kHz, PM ~62 deg. A wider loop is\n  not reachable with C4 >= 3.3 nF and would worsen 1-5 MHz phase noise (the tag band).\n- Spur-free channels with a 26 MHz TCXO: multiples of 13 MHz (2405, 2418, ..., 2483 MHz).\n- Register plan and per-channel words: docs/lmx2582_loop_filter.md (verify with TICS Pro)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 650 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "f7d71bab-91ec-5914-ab00-f62d15ec2dbe"))
